				<h3 data-i18n="serv2Title" class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-stone-900">Bureautique & Papeterie</h3>
				<p data-i18n="serv2Desc" class="text-stone-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Tout pour le bureau : papier, classement, imprimantes et accessoires professionnels.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col items-center text-center">
				<div class="w-14 h-14 bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6">💻</div>
				<h3 data-i18n="serv3Title" class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-stone-900">Informatique</h3>
				<p data-i18n="serv3Desc" class="text-stone-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Accessoires informatiques, supports de stockage et périphériques essentiels.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200/80 shadow-xs hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col items-center text-center">
				<div class="w-14 h-14 bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6">🎁</div>
				<h3 data-i18n="serv4Title" class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-stone-900">Jouets & Cadeaux</h3>
				<p data-i18n="serv4Desc" class="text-stone-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Une magnifique collection de jouets et d'idées cadeaux pour toutes les occasions.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Location & Contact Info Section -->
	<section id="contact" class="py-20 bg-stone-50 border-y border-stone-100 px-6">
		<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10">
			<div class="bg-white p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200/80 shadow-xs">
				<span data-i18n="locationTag" class="text-amber-700 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2">Localisation</span>
				<h3 data-i18n="locationTitle" class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-stone-900">Où Nous Trouver</h3>
				<div class="space-y-4 text-stone-700">
					<div class="flex items-start gap-4">
						<span class="text-2xl mt-0.5">📍</span>
						<div>
							<div data-i18n="addressLabel" class="font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm">Adresse</div>
							<div data-i18n="addressVal" class="text-sm text-stone-600">Medjez el Bab, Tunisie</div>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="flex items-start gap-4">
						<span class="text-2xl mt-0.5">📞</span>
						<div>
							<div data-i18n="phoneLabel" class="font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm">Téléphone</div>
							<a href="tel:94134128" data-i18n="phoneVal" class="text-sm text-amber-700 font-bold hover:underline">94 134 128</a>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="flex items-start gap-4">
						<span class="text-2xl mt-0.5">🕒</span>
						<div>
							<div data-i18n="hoursLabel" class="font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm">Disponibilité</div>
							<div data-i18n="hoursVal" class="text-sm text-stone-600">Ouvert du Lundi au Samedi</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="bg-white p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200/80 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
				<div>
					<span data-i18n="socialTag" class="text-amber-700 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2">Réseaux Sociaux</span>
					<h3 data-i18n="socialTitle" class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-stone-900">Suivez Sté Dream en Ligne</h3>
					<p data-i18n="socialDesc" class="text-stone-600 text-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed">
						Restez connectés avec nous sur nos réseaux sociaux pour découvrir nos nouveautés, arrivages et offres spéciales.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
					<a href="https://www.instagram.com/stedream1/" target="_blank" class="p-3 bg-stone-50 hover:bg-amber-50 border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl text-center transition-all group">
						<div class="font-bold text-sm text-stone-900 group-hover:text-amber-700" data-i18n="igTitle">Instagram</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-stone-500 truncate" data-i18n="igDesc">@stedream1</div>
					</a>
					<a href="https://www.facebook.com/stedreamlibrary" target="_blank" class="p-3 bg-stone-50 hover:bg-amber-50 border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl text-center transition-all group">
						<div class="font-bold text-sm text-stone-900 group-hover:text-amber-700" data-i18n="fbTitle">Facebook</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-stone-500 truncate" data-i18n="fbDesc">stedreamlibrary</div>
					</a>
					<a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@ste.dream" target="_blank" class="p-3 bg-stone-50 hover:bg-amber-50 border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl text-center transition-all group">
						<div class="font-bold text-sm text-stone-900 group-hover:text-amber-700" data-i18n="tkTitle">TikTok</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-stone-500 truncate" data-i18n="tkDesc">@ste.dream</div>
					</a>
					<a href="https://threads.com/@stedream1" target="_blank" class="p-3 bg-stone-50 hover:bg-amber-50 border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl text-center transition-all group">
						<div class="font-bold text-sm text-stone-900 group-hover:text-amber-700" data-i18n="threadsTitle">Threads</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-stone-500 truncate" data-i18n="threadsDesc">@stedream1</div>
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Browser Minigame Placeholder Section -->
	<section class="py-24 px-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
		<div class="bg-stone-900 text-white rounded-3xl p-10 sm:p-14 border border-stone-800 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
			<div class="absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 w-40 h-40 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-full blur-2xl"></div>
			<span data-i18n="gameTag" class="text-amber-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest block mb-3">Espace Ludique</span>
			<h2 data-i18n="gameTitle" class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold mb-4">Mini-Jeu en Ligne</h2>
			<p data-i18n="gameDesc" class="text-stone-300 text-base mb-8 max-w-lg mx-auto leading-relaxed">
				Un espace de divertissement interactif optimisé pour les navigateurs mobiles. Bientôt disponible avec de nouveaux mini-jeux amusants !
			</p>

			<!-- Game Placeholder Container (Ready for specs) -->
			<div id="minigame-container" class="bg-stone-950 border border-stone-800 rounded-2xl p-8 max-w-md mx-auto flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-[220px]">
				<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-4 animate-bounce">🎮</div>
				<p data-i18n="gamePlaceholder" class="text-stone-400 text-sm font-medium">
					Le mini-jeu sera intégré ici selon vos spécifications.
				</p>
				<span class="mt-4 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-stone-600 bg-stone-900 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Mobile Friendly</span>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</MainLayout>
